# CTA and Follow-Up Assets

## Primary CTA

Want to know whether your ERP is ready for a queryable intelligence layer?

Comment `READY` and we’ll send you the five-signal checklist.

## Download-page CTA

Your checklist is ready.

If your score is 6 or higher, your team may be experiencing an ERP access problem rather than an ERP data problem.

Book an ERP Readability Review to identify:

- The questions consuming the most manual effort.
- The departments and data sources involved.
- The best first pilot use case.
- The controls required for safe implementation.

## Form fields

- Name
- Work email
- Company
- Role
- Industry
- ERP or finance system
- Approximate reporting hours per week
- Highest-scoring checklist signal
- Biggest unanswered business question

## Thank-you page

Your ERP may already contain the answers your team needs.

The next step is to identify the questions that consume the most reporting time and determine whether they can be answered safely from your existing data.

